  "beard:bdanchornat": "an anchor beard in natural dark brown-black, shown as a barber's style reference: the cheeks, the jaw sides, the sideburns and the neck are completely clean-shaven bare skin; the only facial hair is three separate pieces: a moustache that stops above the mouth corners, a pointed chin beard under the lower lip, and two short thin lines running from it along the jawline for a few centimetres; IMPORTANT: bare shaved skin at both corners of the mouth, the moustache does not touch the chin beard",
