  "beard:bdcircleblk": "a circle beard in deep black, shown as a barber's style reference: a moustache joined at both mouth corners to a short rounded chin beard, forming one neat closed ring around the mouth; the cheeks, the jaw sides, the sideburns and the neck are completely clean-shaven smooth bare skin",
  "beard:bdcirclebrn": "a circle beard in rich chocolate brown, shown as a barber's style reference: a moustache joined at both mouth corners to a short rounded chin beard, forming one neat closed ring around the mouth; the cheeks, the jaw sides, the sideburns and the neck are completely clean-shaven smooth bare skin with no stubble",
  "beard:bdcirclegrey": "a circle beard in even salt-and-pepper grey, shown as a barber's style reference: a moustache joined at both mouth corners to a short rounded chin beard, forming one neat closed ring around the mouth; the cheeks, the jaw sides, the sideburns and the neck are completely clean-shaven smooth bare skin with no stubble",
  "beard:bdcirclehenna": "a circle beard dyed a henna copper-red, shown as a barber's style reference: a moustache joined at both mouth corners to a short rounded chin beard, forming one neat closed ring around the mouth; the cheeks, the jaw sides, the sideburns and the neck are completely clean-shaven smooth bare skin with no stubble; the head hair and eyebrows stay natural black",
  "beard:bdcirclenat": "a circle beard in its natural dark brown-black colour, shown as a barber's style reference: a moustache joined at both mouth corners to a short rounded chin beard, forming one neat closed ring around the mouth; the cheeks, the jaw sides, the sideburns and the neck are completely clean-shaven smooth bare skin with no stubble",
  "beard:bdcleanblk": "a completely clean-shaven face with no beard, no moustache and no stubble, showing a faint natural shave shadow: the dark roots seen through freshly shaved skin make the jaw, chin and upper lip only slightly darker and greyer than the cheeks, smooth and evenly blended into the skin, with no blue or coloured cast",
  "beard:bdcleanbrn": "a completely clean-shaven face with no beard, no moustache and no stubble, shown as a barber's reference for short sideburns: each sideburn stops at the middle of the ear, level with the ear opening and well above the earlobe, ending in a crisp straight horizontal edge; below it the skin in front of the ear is smooth and exactly the same tone as the cheek",
  "beard:bdcleanhenna": "a completely clean-shaven face with no beard, no moustache and no stubble, shown as a barber's reference for no sideburns: the haircut ends above the top of the ear, and the whole area in front of the ear, from the top of the ear down to the jaw, is smooth bare skin with no hair at all",
  "beard:bdgoateebrn": "a goatee in rich chocolate brown, shown as a barber's style reference: the cheeks, the whole jaw line, the sideburns and the neck are completely clean-shaven smooth bare skin; the only facial hair is a moustache joined by thin lines at the mouth corners to a narrow chin beard, no wider than the mouth, that hangs a little below the chin",
